wp:hammer:57.description:
A weapon to shatter space and time;
a weapon to destroy life itself.
Such is the upgraded Shell Hammer.

wp:switch-axe:45.description:
An upgraded Nihil Switch Axe.
To the penitent, it is salvation;
to the recalcitrant, a dire judge.
